component SkOverD
export Executable

(*) Skeptic's probe 3d: a generic top-level function named exp whose bound is
(*) the compiler world's marker trait Number, so that one instantiation --
(*) exp[\RR64\] -- has the same signature as the new functional method.  The
(*) target program's own exp takes Array[\T,I\] and so is not this shape, but
(*) the array rung will want to know what the checker does with it.

exp[\T extends Number\](a: T): ZZ32 = 1

run():() = do
    a: ZZ32 = 7
    println("generic exp(7) = " exp[\ZZ32\](a))
end

end
